sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SDK as SDK or uploader
  participant API as Rust API
  participant Auth as Auth middleware
  participant DB as Postgres

  SDK->>API: POST /runs/:id/metrics\nBearer key + optional Idempotency-Key
  API->>Auth: Authenticate and authorize metrics:write
  Auth-->>API: org, project, run, principal
  API->>API: Validate finite values, finite nonnegative step, timestamp
  API->>DB: Begin transaction
  alt Idempotency-Key present
    API->>DB: Claim ingest_requests(org_id, key, body_hash)
    DB-->>API: New claim or stored response
  end
  API->>DB: Upsert metric_series rows
  API->>DB: Bulk insert metric_points
  API->>DB: Update metric_series aggregates
  API->>DB: Store idempotent response if needed
  API->>DB: Commit
  API-->>SDK: {"inserted": n}
